{"scenario": "cli/browser-install-from-a-fixture", "requires": ["v1"], "doc": "ratatoskr browser install (agent browser Task 17): the pinned archive (a fixture folder through the test-hooks variables DRGNX_TEST_CFT_BASE and DRGNX_TEST_PINS) is checked against its digest, unpacked into <data>/browsers/V.partial and renamed to V with installed.json; the shell (this platform's folder: the fixture has linux64, linux-arm64, mac-arm64 and mac-x64) runs; list shows the download; a second install downloads nothing; no .partial is left."}
{"do": "root"}
{"do": "run", "args": ["browser", "install", "--version", "100.0.0.1", "--json"], "env": {"DRGNX_TEST_CFT_BASE": "file://$SCENARIOS/../fixtures/browser", "DRGNX_TEST_PINS": "$SCENARIOS/../fixtures/browser/pins.json"}, "expect_code": 0, "expect_stdout": {"ok": true, "installed": {"version": "100.0.0.1", "released": "2026-01-02", "already": false}}}
{"do": "file", "path": "$DATA/browsers/100.0.0.1/installed.json", "exists": true}
{"do": "run", "bin": "/bin/sh", "args": ["-c", "$DATA/browsers/100.0.0.1/chrome-headless-shell-*/chrome-headless-shell"], "expect_code": 0, "expect_stdout": "HeadlessChrome 100.0.0.1"}
{"do": "run", "bin": "/bin/sh", "args": ["-c", "test -z \"$(ls $DATA/browsers | grep partial)\" && test ! -e $DATA/browsers/100.0.0.1/download.zip"], "expect_code": 0}
{"do": "run", "args": ["browser", "list", "--json"], "env": {"DRGNX_TEST_PINS": "$SCENARIOS/../fixtures/browser/pins.json"}, "expect_code": 0, "expect_stdout": {"installed": [{"version": "100.0.0.1", "released": "2026-01-02"}], "pinned": [{"version": "100.0.0.1"}, {"version": "100.0.0.2"}]}}
{"do": "run", "args": ["browser", "install", "--version", "100.0.0.1", "--json"], "env": {"DRGNX_TEST_CFT_BASE": "file://$SCENARIOS/../fixtures/nowhere", "DRGNX_TEST_PINS": "$SCENARIOS/../fixtures/browser/pins.json"}, "expect_code": 0, "expect_stdout": {"ok": true, "installed": {"already": true}}}
{"do": "run", "args": ["browser", "install", "--version", "7.7.7.7"], "env": {"DRGNX_TEST_PINS": "$SCENARIOS/../fixtures/browser/pins.json"}, "expect_code": 1, "expect_stderr": "not one drgnx knows a digest for"}
